{"v":2,"s":"c","w":4,"steps":[{"t":"read","h":"How the table is built","b":"<p>The periodic table (periodni sistem) has <b>18 groups</b> (grupe, columns) and <b>7 periods</b> (periode, rows).</p><ul><li><b>Period number</b> = number of electron shells.</li><li>For the main groups 1, 2 and 13–18, the group tells the valence electrons: group 1 → 1, group 2 → 2, group 13 → 3 … group 17 → 7.</li></ul><p>Group names: 1 alkali metals (alkalni metali), 2 alkaline earth metals (zemnoalkalni), 17 halogens (halogeni), 18 noble gases (plemeniti gasovi).</p><div class=\"callout\">A city map: the group is the street, where neighbors share habits; the period is the floor of the building.</div><figure class=\"fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 166\" text-anchor=\"middle\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"The periodic table: 18 groups (columns), 7 periods (rows). Metals on the left, nonmetals on the upper right, metalloids along the staircase.\"><defs><marker id=\"ah\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" class=\"ink\"/></marker><marker id=\"ahc\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" class=\"a\"/></marker></defs><text x=\"15\" y=\"15\" font-size=\"7\">1</text><text x=\"32\" y=\"15\" font-size=\"7\">2</text><text x=\"219\" y=\"15\" font-size=\"7\">13</text><text x=\"236\" y=\"15\" font-size=\"7\">14</text><text x=\"253\" y=\"15\" font-size=\"7\">15</text><text x=\"270\" y=\"15\" font-size=\"7\">16</text><text x=\"287\" y=\"15\" font-size=\"7\">17</text><text x=\"304\" y=\"15\" font-size=\"7\">18</text><text x=\"3\" y=\"31\" font-size=\"7\">1</text><text x=\"3\" y=\"48\" font-size=\"7\">2</text><text x=\"3\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"7\">3</text><text x=\"3\" y=\"82\" font-size=\"7\">4</text><text x=\"3\" y=\"99\" font-size=\"7\">5</text><text x=\"3\" y=\"116\" font-size=\"7\">6</text><text x=\"3\" y=