lass=\"\">Hf</text><rect x=\"75\" y=\"105\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\" class=\"sf\"/><text x=\"83\" y=\"116\" font-size=\"6.5\" class=\"\">Ta</text><rect x=\"92\" y=\"105\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\" class=\"sf\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"116\" font-size=\"6.5\" class=\"\">W</text><rect x=\"109\" y=\"105\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\" class=\"sf\"/><text x=\"117\" y=\"116\" font-size=\"6.5\" class=\"\">Re</text><rect x=\"126\" y=\"105\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\" class=\"sf\"/><text x=\"134\" y=\"116\" font-size=\"6.5\" class=\"\">Os</text><rect x=\"143\" y=\"105\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\" class=\"sf\"/><text x=\"151\" y=\"116\" font-size=\"6.5\" class=\"\">Ir</text><rect x=\"160\" y=\"105\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\" class=\"sf\"/><text x=\"168\" y=\"116\" font-size=\"6.5\" class=\"\">Pt</text><rect x=\"177\" y=\"105\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\" class=\"sf\"/><text x=\"185\" y=\"116\" font-size=\"6.5\" class=\"\">Au</text><rect x=\"194\" y=\"105\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\" class=\"sf\"/><text x=\"202\" y=\"116\" font-size=\"6.5\" class=\"\">Hg</text><rect x=\"211\" y=\"105\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\" class=\"sf\"/><text x=\"219\" y=\"116\" font-size=\"6.5\" class=\"\">Tl</text><rect x=\"228\" y=\"105\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\" class=\"sf\"/><text x=\"236\" y=\"116\" font-size=\"6.5\" class=\"\">Pb</text><rect x=\"245\" y=\"105\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\" class=\"sf\"/><text x=\"253\" y=\"116\" font-size=\"6.5\" class=\"\">Bi</text><rect x=\"262\" y=\"105\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\" class=\"sf\"/><text x=\"270\" y=\"116\" font-size=\"6.5\" class=\"\">Po</text><rect x=\"279\" y=\"105\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\" class=\"a\"/><text x=\"287\" y=\"116\" font-size=\"6.5\" class=\"on\">At</text><rect x=\"296\" y=\"105\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\" class=\"mu\"/><text x=\"304\" y=\"116\" font-size=\"6.5\" class=\"on\">Rn</text><rect x=\"7\" y=\"122\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\" class=\"sf\"/><text x=\"15\" y=\"133\" font-size=\"6.5\" class=\"\">Fr</text><rect x=\"24\" y=\"122\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\" class=\"sf\"/><text x=\"32\" y=\"133\" font-size=\"6.5\" class=\"\">Ra</text><rect x=\"41\" y=\"122\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\" class=\"sf\"/><text x=\"49\" y=\"133\" font-size=\"6.5\" class=\"\">Ac</text><rect x=\"58\" y=\"122\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\" class=\"sf\"/><text x=\"66\" y=\"133\" font-size=\"6.5\" class=\"\">Rf</text><rect x=\"75\" y=\"122\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\" class=\"sf\"/><text x=\"83\" y=\"133\" font-size=\"6.5\" class=\"\">Db</text><rect x=\"92\" y=\"122\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\" class=\"sf\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"133\" font-size=\"6.5\" class=\"\">Sg</text><rect x=\"109\" y=\"122\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\" class=\"sf\"/><text x=\"117\" y=\"133\" font-size=\"6.5\" class=\"\">Bh</text><rect x=\"126\" y=\"122\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\" class=\"sf\"/><text x=\"134\" y=\"133\" font-size=\"6.5\" class=\"\">Hs</text><rect x=\"143\" y=\"122\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\" class=\"sf\"/><text x=\"151\" y=\"133\" font-size=\"6.5\" class=\"\">Mt</text><rect x=\"160\" y=\"122\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\" class=\"sf\"/><text x=\"168\" y=\"133\" font-size=\"6.5\" class=\"\">Ds</text><rect x=\"177\" y=\"122\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\" class=\"sf\"/><text x=\"185\" y=\"133\" font-size=\"6.5\" class=\"\">Rg</text><rect x=\"194\" y=\"122\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\" class=\"sf\"/><text x=\"202\" y=\"133\" font-size=\"6.5\" class=\"\">Cn</text><rect x=\"211\" y=\"122\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\" class=\"sf\"/><text x=\"219\" y=\"133\" font-size=\"6.5\" class=\"\">Nh</text><rect x=\"228\" y=\"122\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\" class=\"sf\"/><text x=\"236\" y=\"133\" font-size=\"6.5\" class=\"\">Fl</text><rect x=\"245\" y=\"122\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\" class=\"sf\"/><text x=\"253\" y=\"133\" font-size=\"6.5\" class=\"\">Mc</text><rect x=\"262\" y=\"122\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\" class=\"sf\"/><text x=\"270\" y=\"133\" font-size=\"6.5\" class=\"\">Lv</text><rect x=\"279\" y=\"122\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\" class=\"a\"/><text x=\"287\" y=\"133\" font-size=\"6.5\" class=\"on\">Ts</text><rect x=\"296\" y=\"122\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\" class=\"mu\"/><text x=\"304\" y=\"133\" font-size=\"6.5\" class=\"on\">Og</text><rect x=\"10\" y=\"148\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\" class=\"sf\"/><text x=\"25\" y=\"157\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"10\">metals</text><rect x=\"88\" y=\"148\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\" class=\"ge\"/><text x=\"103\" y=\"157\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"10\">metalloids</text><rect x=\"166\" y=\"148\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\" class=\"a\"/><text x=\"181\" y=\"157\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"10\">nonmetals</text><rect x=\"244\" y=\"148\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\" class=\"mu\"/><text x=\"259\" y=\"157\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"10\">noble gases</text></svg><figcaption>The periodic table: 18 groups (columns), 7 periods (rows). Metals on the left, nonmetals on the upper right, metalloids along the staircase.</figcaption></figure>"},{"t":"read","h":"Metals and nonmetals","b":"<p><b>Metals</b> (metali) are on the left and in the middle: they shine, conduct, and lose electrons to form cations.</p><p><b>Nonmetals</b> (nemetali) are on the upper right: they gain or share electrons.</p><p>Along the staircase line are <b>metalloids</b> (metaloidi) such as B, Si, Ge, As. Silicon, the backbone of most minerals, is one of them.</p>"},{"t":"read","h":"Trends","b":"<ul><li><b>Atomic radius</b> grows down a group (more shells) and to the left in a period.</li><li><b>Metallic character</b> grows down and to the left: Cs is very reactive, Na less so.</li><li><b>Electronegativity</b> (elektronegativnost) — how strongly an atom pulls shared electrons — grows up and to the right. Fluorine is the highest (4.0).</li></ul><p>From the position you can predict the usual charge: group 1 → +1, group 2 → +2, group 13 → +3, group 15 → −3, group 16 → −2, group 17 → −1.</p>"},{"t":"ex","q":"An element is in period 3, group 16. What is it and what ion does it form?","s":["Period 3 → 3 shells. Group 16 → 6 valence electrons.","Distribution 2, 8, 6 → Z = 16, sulfur.","It needs 2 electrons for an octet, so it gains 2."],"a":"Sulfur, S²⁻, a nonmetal"},{"t":"mc","q":"Which element is the most electronegative?","o":["Na","O","F","Cl"],"a":2,"e":"Electronegativity grows up and to the right; F is at the top right (noble gases excluded)."},{"t":"mc","q":"Which atom is larger, Na or K?","o":["Na","K","the same"],"a":1,"e":"K is one period lower — it has one more shell."},{"t":"num","q":"In which period is calcium (Z = 20)?","a":4,"u":"","e":"2, 8, 8, 2 → 4 shells → period 4."},{"t":"mc","q":"The halogens are in group:","o":["1","2","17","18"],"a":2,"e":"F, Cl, Br, I — group 17, 7 valence electrons."},{"t":"tf","q":"Metals are on the right side of the periodic table.","a":false,"e":"Metals are on the left and in the middle; nonmetals are on the upper right."}]}